	(text_box "Components connected to V_{C} pin are part of the LT3757's loop compensation network.\nThe capacitor voltage raises proportionally with (but is not equal to) V_{out}.\nOnce the capacitor charges to 1.78 V, the loop compensation feature stops."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
